  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://shs.bihar.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Bihar Swastha Vibhag State Health Society (Bihar SHSB)</a></span> has released the short notice for the post of Ayush Medical Officer (Ayush Chikitsak). This recruitment has been issued for 2619 posts. Online applying process for Bihar SHS Ayush Medical Officer Recruitment 2025 has started from 31 May 2025 &amp; the candidates can apply till 15 June 2025. Candidates must check the complete details for Bihar SHS Ayush Medical Officer Recruitment 2025 which has given below.&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bihar Swastha Vibhag State Health Society (Bihar SHSB)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Bihar SHS Ayush Medical Officer Recruitment 2025</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bihar SHS Ayush MO Advt. No. 05/2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>31 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>15 June 2025</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>15 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Later</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General, EWS, BC, EBC : <strong>Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Other State Candidates : <strong>Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST of Bihar Candidates : <strong>Rs. 125-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Female of Bihar Candidates : <strong>Rs. 125/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Ph Candidates : <strong>Rs. 125/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar SHS Ayush Medical Officer Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 August 2024</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>37 Yrs. Male-(UR /EWS)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Yrs. Female-(UR /EWS)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Yrs. Male / Female-(BC / MBC)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>42 Yrs. Male / Female-(SC / ST)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per Bihar SHS Ayush Medical Officer Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar SHS Ayush MO 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 2619 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Ayush Doctor (Ayurvedic)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1411</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Ayush&nbsp;Doctor (Homoeopathic)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">706</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Ayush&nbsp;Doctor (Unani)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">502</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Bihar SHS Ayush MO Recruitment 2025 : Category Wise Vacancy Details</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1049</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">259</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">EBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">431</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">BC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">288</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">WBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">88</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">473</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">31</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Bihar SHS Ayush Medical Officer Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.8554%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.1446%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.8554%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Ayush Doctor (Ayurvedic)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.1446%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">A Bachelor of Ayurvedic Medicine and Surgery (B.A.M.S.) degree from any recognized university, which is included in the schedule of the Central Council of Indian Medicine, New Delhi.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Must have completed a compulsory rotatory internship.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Must be registered with the Bihar State Council of Ayurvedic and Unani Medicines, Patna.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.8554%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Ayush&nbsp;Doctor (Homoeopathic)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.1446%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">A Bachelor of Homoeopathic Medicine and Surgery (B.H.M.S.) degree from any recognized university, which is included in the schedule of the Central Council of Homoeopathy, New Delhi.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Must have completed a compulsory rotatory internship.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Must be registered with the Bihar State Council of Homoeopathic Medicine, Patna.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.8554%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Ayush&nbsp;Doctor (Unani)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.1446%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">A Bachelor of Unani Medicine and Surgery (B.U.M.S.) degree from any recognized university, which is included in the schedule of the Central Council of Indian Medicine, New Delhi.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Must have completed a compulsory rotatory internship.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Must be registered with the Bihar State Council of Ayurvedic and Unani Medicines, Patna.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar SHS Ayush Medical Officer Online Form 2025 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://shs.bihar.gov.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the Bihar SHSB before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sarkari Result 2025</a> Notification Here – <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check Now.</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for 